{"synopsis":"Nama paling agung di tanah ini: Gauri. Sosok yang melindungi nama itu. Orang-orang menjulukinya Kaisar Besi! Dialah Ko Jin-cheon, jenderal besar terakhir dari Gauri (Goguryeo) yang telah runtuh.\n\nPada saat kekalahan terakhir, ia terjatuh ke dunia lain bersama pasukan elitnya, Kavaleri Hantu Berzirah Hitam. Sebuah negeri asing tempat para elf, orc, dwarf, dan penyihir hidup berdampingan. Jika mereka tak bisa kembali, maka mereka harus membangun Gauri yang baru.\n\nKo Jin-cheon pun kembali mengibarkan benderanya, menaklukkan benua sekali lagi.","alternative_title":"강철의 열제","author":"Gauri, Suri","artist":"Shin Inseong","chapters":[{"chapter_id":"30bc95f7-699b-4e4b-a3ef-45434ffdd94c","number":"50","chapter":"50","title":"","date":"2026-06-02","released":"2026-06-02","images":["https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_3280887e-0592-480c-8270-dce59239babd/chapter_ch_50/1.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_3280887e-0592-480c-8270-dce59239babd/chapter_ch_50/2.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_3280887e-0592-480c-8270-dce59239babd/chapter_ch_50/3.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_3280887e-0592-480c-8270-dce59239babd/chapter_ch_50/4.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_3280887e-0592-480c-8270-dce59239babd/chapter_ch_50/5.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_3280887e-0592-480c-8270-dce59239babd/chapter_ch_50/6.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_3280887e-0592-480c-8270-dce59239babd/chapter_ch_50/7.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_3280887e-0592-480c-8270-dce59239babd/chapter_ch_50/8.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_3280887e-0592-480c-8270-dce59239babd/chapter_ch_50/9.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_3280887e-0592-480c-8270-dce59239babd/chapter_ch_50/10.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_3280887e-0592-480c-8270-dce59239babd/chapter_ch_50/11.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_3280887e-0592-480c-8270-dce59239babd/chapter_ch_50/12.webp"]},{"chapter_id":"ab189